fix(deploy): static fallback for missing DB config and robust CI workflow

- Add env.ini detection fallback in index.php, privacy.php, terms.php so static
  HTML pages are served until the database is configured.
- Update .htaccess rewrite to avoid redirecting existing .html files.
- Fix GitHub Actions SSH host-key handling: use known_hosts if provided,
  otherwise accept-new.
- Make database migration step conditional on remote env.ini existence to avoid
  CI failures before POLASCIN_ENV_INI secret is configured.
- Disable local .git/hooks post-commit deploy in favor of GitHub Actions.

